<title>USA: ILLINOIS DIRECT HOGS STEADY/$0.50 HIGHER - USDA.</title>
<headline>ILLINOIS DIRECT HOGS STEADY/$0.50 HIGHER - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were steady-$0.50 higher. Demand moderate. Top $56.50 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-2  230-260 lbs. 55.00-56.50</p>
<p>US 2-3  230-260 lbs. 54.00-55.50</p>
<p>Sows: Steady to weak. Top 49.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3  300-400 lbs. 42.00-44.00</p>
<p>	  400-500 lbs. 44.00-46.00</p>
<p>	  500-600 lbs. 45.00-47.00, few 48.00</p>
<p>few over 600 lbs. 47.00-48.00, few 49.00</p>
</text>
